
    What is the purpose of the src/ directory structure?
      to help the code be clean and seperation of the concerns for the test cases.
    Why do we use super().__init__() in the subclass?
      so that we are able to specify specific items within the subclass without chnaging the main one.
    How does inheritance help us avoid code duplication?
      it allows us to blanket the code with a common class!
